        "text": "Understanding strategies for deploying\nthe code\nFor projects where the development team is not the end user, it is important to come up\nwith a strategy to deploy the code for the end user. For relatively large-scale projects, when\nthere is a well-defined DEV and PROD environment, deploying the code and strategizing\nit becomes important.\nPython is the language of choice for cloud and cluster computing environments as well.\nIssues related to deploying the code are listed as follows:\n\u2022I Exactly the same transformations need to happen in DEV , TEST , and PROD\nenvironments.\n\u2022I As the code keeps getting updated in the DEV environment, how will the changes be\nsynced to the PROD environment?\n\u2022I What type of testing do you plan to do in the DEV and PROD environments?\nLet's look into two main strategies for deploying the code.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Batch development\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
